        <mxCell id="seq6_22" value="&lt;b&gt;범례 (UML 시퀀스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;실선 + 채운 화살촉: 동기 호출 (서비스 · HTTP 요청) — 응답이 올 때까지 기다림&lt;br&gt;실선 + 열린 화살촉: 비동기 메시지 (토픽 · 액션 목표 · 피드백 · 보고 · 알림) — 기다리지 않음&lt;br&gt;점선 + 열린 화살촉: 응답 (서비스 응답 · HTTP 응답 · 액션 결과)&lt;br&gt;흰 세로 막대 (실행 박스): 동기 호출을 받아 응답할 때까지 처리하는 구간 ('6-1' · '6-4')&lt;br&gt;막대 위에 겹친 짧은 막대: 처리 중 자기 메시지 (내부 처리)&lt;br&gt;alt / opt / loop: 조합 단편 · 녹색 머리: 웹 서비스 영역&lt;br&gt;주황 선: «미확정» · «추후 논의» · «검토 중» 메시지 (실선 · 점선 구분은 위와 같음)&lt;br&gt;방식(서비스 · 토픽)이 정해지지 않은 요청 · 보고는 비동기로 표시 (서비스로 정해지면 응답 · 막대 추가)" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="1462" width="520" height="156" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="seq6_m1" parent="1" value="1. /{arm}/state: ERROR (한 팔이라도 장애 발생)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1280" y="150" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="150" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m2" parent="1" value="2. 전체 작업 중단 (MODE_PAUSE 또는 MODE_STOP «추후 논의»)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="186" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="204" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="940" y="186" /><mxPoint x="940" y="204" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m3" parent="1" value="3. 정지 지시 (이동 중이면 이동을 마친 뒤) «미확정»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="236" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1090" y="236" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m4" parent="1" value="4. 정지 지시 «미확정» (하던 교환을 마칠지 «추후 논의»)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="272" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1470" y="272" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m5" parent="1" value="5. Phody 장애 보고 «미확정 D-06»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="308" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="308" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m6" parent="1" value="6. 주문 처리 보류 (HELD, detail: Phody 장애)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="710" y="378" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="396" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="750" y="378" /><mxPoint x="750" y="396" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m7" parent="1" value="opt" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=70;height=24;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="330" width="330" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m8" parent="1" value="[담는 중인 주문]" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="718" y="330" width="600" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m9" parent="1" value="7. 진행 상황 보고: Phody 장애 «미확정 D-06»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="710" y="442" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="520" y="442" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m10" parent="1" value="8. 장애 전달" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="520" y="478" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="478" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m11" parent="1" value="9. DB 기록 (주문 처리 보류)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="514" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="532" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="370" y="514" /><mxPoint x="370" y="532" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m12" parent="1" value="10. WS: Phody 장애 알림 (관리자)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="564" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="140" y="564" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m13" parent="1" value="11. 관리자: 장애 조치 (현장)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="600" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="140" y="618" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="180" y="600" /><mxPoint x="180" y="618" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m14" parent="1" value="12. 재시작 입력 «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="684" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="684" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m15" parent="1" value="13. 재시작 전달 (브리지 · 주문 처리 경유) «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="720" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="720" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m16" parent="1" value="14. /{arm}/state: 대기 (IDLE) «미확정»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1280" y="756" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="756" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m17" parent="1" value="15. 운행 재개 (RUN)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="792" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="810" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="940" y="792" /><mxPoint x="940" y="810" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m18" parent="1" value="16. 재개 지시 «미확정»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="842" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1090" y="842" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m19" parent="1" value="17. 재개 지시 «미확정»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="878" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1470" y="878" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m20" parent="1" value="18. 재개 보고 «미확정»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="914" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="914" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m21" parent="1" value="19. 담는 중 (FILLING) [사유=Phody]" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="710" y="950" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="968" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="750" y="950" /><mxPoint x="750" y="968" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m22" parent="1" value="20. FillBasket 목표 (남은 상품) «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="1000" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1280" y="1000" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m23" parent="1" value="이후 '6-1' 21번(피드백)부터 같은 흐름" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="1020" width="520" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m24" parent="1" value="21. 장애 조치 불가 입력 «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="1098" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="1098" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m25" parent="1" value="22. 조치 불가 전달 (브리지 경유) «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="1134" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="1134" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m26" parent="1" value="23. 주문 처리 중단 (ABORTED)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="710" y="1170" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="1188" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="750" y="1170" /><mxPoint x="750" y="1188" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m27" parent="1" value="24. 진행 상황 보고: 주문 처리 중단" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="710" y="1220" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="520" y="1220" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m28" parent="1" value="25. 진행 상황 전달" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="520" y="1256" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="1256" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m29" parent="1" value="26. DB 기록 (주문 처리 중단)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="1292" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="1310" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="370" y="1292" /><mxPoint x="370" y="1310" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m30" parent="1" value="27. WS: 주문 처리 중단 (관리자)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="1342" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="140" y="1342" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m31" parent="1" value="운행을 다시 시작하는 방법 · 관리자 수동 주문 처리 «추후 논의»" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="1362" width="560" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m32" parent="1" value="alt" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=70;height=24;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="636" width="1470" height="764" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m33" parent="1" value="[장애 조치됨: 수리 후 재시작 (SR-34)]" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="148" y="636" width="600" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m34" parent="1" value="" style="shape=line;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#555555;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1049" width="1470" height="10" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m35" parent="1" value="[장애 조치 불가]" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="1056" width="600" height="20" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m36" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;판단 (D-11)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Phody의 두 팔 중 한 팔만 장애가 발생해도 전체 작업을 중단합니다.&lt;br&gt;상태 기준: '4-1. Phody 장애 예외' · '2. 주문' 탭" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1462" width="560" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq6_m37" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;«추후 논의»&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;중단 모드(MODE_PAUSE · MODE_STOP) · 점유 중인 공유 공간 유지(검토 중)&lt;br&gt;재시작 뒤 남은 상품을 다시 담는 방법 · 관리자 알림 방식(D-06)&lt;br&gt;담는 중이 아닌 주문(배정됨 · 운반 중)의 처리" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="1462" width="520" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="version-label" value="v1.7 · 2026-11-17" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="-26.0" width="200" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
