        <mxCell id="seq7_22" value="&lt;b&gt;범례 (UML 시퀀스)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;실선 + 채운 화살촉: 동기 호출 (서비스 · HTTP 요청) — 응답이 올 때까지 기다림&lt;br&gt;실선 + 열린 화살촉: 비동기 메시지 (토픽 · 액션 목표 · 피드백 · 보고 · 알림) — 기다리지 않음&lt;br&gt;점선 + 열린 화살촉: 응답 (서비스 응답 · HTTP 응답 · 액션 결과)&lt;br&gt;흰 세로 막대 (실행 박스): 동기 호출을 받아 응답할 때까지 처리하는 구간 ('6-1' · '6-4')&lt;br&gt;막대 위에 겹친 짧은 막대: 처리 중 자기 메시지 (내부 처리)&lt;br&gt;alt / opt / loop: 조합 단편 · 녹색 머리: 웹 서비스 영역&lt;br&gt;주황 선: «미확정» · «추후 논의» · «검토 중» 메시지 (실선 · 점선 구분은 위와 같음)&lt;br&gt;방식(서비스 · 토픽)이 정해지지 않은 요청 · 보고는 비동기로 표시 (서비스로 정해지면 응답 · 막대 추가)" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1150" y="902" width="520" height="156" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="seq7_m1" parent="1" value="1. /arm_ship/state: ERROR" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1470" y="150" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="150" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m2" parent="1" value="2. 출고 구역 배정 중지 (Phony 배정 불가 «추후 논의»)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="186" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="204" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="940" y="186" /><mxPoint x="940" y="204" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m3" parent="1" value="3. 출고 구역 앞에서 이동 중 대기 (WAITING) «검토 중»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="236" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1280" y="236" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m4" parent="1" value="4. Phony 장애 보고 «미확정 D-06»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="272" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="710" y="272" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m5" parent="1" value="5. 진행 상황 보고: Phony 장애 «미확정 D-06»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="710" y="308" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="520" y="308" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m6" parent="1" value="6. 장애 전달" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="520" y="344" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="344" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m7" parent="1" value="7. WS: Phony 장애 알림 (관리자)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="380" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="140" y="380" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m8" parent="1" value="8. 관리자: 출고 구역 Pode의 바구니를 손으로 교환 (현장)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="416" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="140" y="434" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="180" y="416" /><mxPoint x="180" y="434" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m9" parent="1" value="9. 교환 확인 입력 (ConfirmClear «추후 논의»)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="466" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="466" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m10" parent="1" value="10. 확인 전달 (브리지 · 주문 처리 경유) «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="502" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="502" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m11" parent="1" value="11. 배터리 확인 ('3. Pode' 탭)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="538" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="556" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="940" y="538" /><mxPoint x="940" y="556" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m12" parent="1" value="12. 복귀 또는 충전&lt;br&gt;('6-1' 36~39번과 같음)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="588" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1090" y="588" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m13" parent="1" value="뒤따르는 Pode: 출고 구역이 비면 대기를 마칩니다('5-1' 탭). 그 뒤 처리는 «추후 논의»" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="608" width="620" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m14" parent="1" value="13. 관리자: Phony 수리 · 처리 완료 (현장)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="654" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="140" y="672" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="180" y="654" /><mxPoint x="180" y="672" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m15" parent="1" value="14. 처리 완료 입력 «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140" y="704" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="330" y="704" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m16" parent="1" value="15. 처리 완료 전달 (브리지 · 주문 처리 경유) «추후 논의»" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#9a5b00;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="330" y="740" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="740" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m17" parent="1" value="16. /arm_ship/state: 배정 가능 (available = true «검토 중»)" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1470" y="776" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="776" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m18" parent="1" value="17. 출고 구역 배정 재개" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endSize=10;fontSize=10;align=left;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="900" y="812" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="900" y="830" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="940" y="812" /><mxPoint x="940" y="830" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m19" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;판단 (D-11)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Phony에 장애가 발생하면 관리자가 수동으로 처리합니다.&lt;br&gt;상태 기준: '5-1. Phony 장애 예외' · '5. Phony' 탭" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="902" width="560" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="seq7_m20" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;«추후 논의»&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;손으로 교환한 주문의 상태(출고됨으로 볼지)와 보고 방법&lt;br&gt;장애 때 하던 교환의 처리 · 관리자 알림 방식(D-06)" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="902" width="520" height="56" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="version-label" value="v1.7 · 2026-11-17" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="-26.0" width="200" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
